{"version":1,"content":"<p>比亞迪股份有限公司今日（23日），宣布已在港成立比亞迪智慧交通（香港）有限公司，落戶科學園核心大廈，並計劃將雲巴（SkyShuttle）等軌道交通方案引進香港，期望能把新能源及軌道交通的研發和營運經驗帶到香港，並以香港作為拓展國際軌道交通業務的平台。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T09:23:48.994051+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":125,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T08:56:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T15:33:59.983370+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T09:18:02.762770+00:00","content_hash":"6472f786df9ca7e627a3960e415f3c952cf4c50fc318ef972cb602496f5f2dc4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}